msgid "Someone tried to sign up with your email"
msgstr "Someone tried to sign up with your email"

msgid "Someone tried to create a %{product} account with this email address."
msgstr "Someone tried to create a %{product} account with this email address."

msgid "If it was you, sign in to add a profile, or reset your password if you forgot it."
msgstr "If it was you, sign in to add a profile, or reset your password if you forgot it."

msgid "Sign in"
msgstr "Sign in"

msgid "Reset password"
msgstr "Reset password"

msgid "Forgot your password?"
msgstr "Forgot your password?"

msgid "If it wasn't you, you can ignore this email. No account was created and nothing changed."
msgstr "If it wasn't you, you can ignore this email. No account was created and nothing changed."

msgid "Confirm deleting your account"
msgstr "Confirm deleting your account"

msgid "You asked to delete your profile @%{handle}."
msgstr "You asked to delete your profile @%{handle}."

msgid "You asked to delete your account with all its profiles."
msgstr "You asked to delete your account with all its profiles."

msgid "Confirm deleting your profile"
msgstr "Confirm deleting your profile"

msgid "After you confirm, the deletion takes place in %{days} days. Until then you can undo it."
msgstr "After you confirm, the deletion takes place in %{days} days. Until then you can undo it."

msgid "Confirm deletion"
msgstr "Confirm deletion"

msgid "The link expires in 24 hours."
msgstr "The link expires in 24 hours."

msgid "If you didn't ask for this, don't open the link and change your password: someone else knows it."
msgstr "If you didn't ask for this, don't open the link and change your password: someone else knows it."
